WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.153
Jack told Eliza about Milky White.

2
00:00:06.154 --> 00:00:18.510
"My father was an explorer," he said.

3
00:00:18.511 --> 00:00:25.307
"He found treasure and gold on his trips."

4
00:00:25.308 --> 00:00:29.897
Eliza's eyes lit up. "Treasure?"

5
00:00:29.898 --> 00:00:38.933
Jack nodded and told Eliza about the treasure and gold.

6
00:00:38.934 --> 00:00:54.186
"But a mean ogre stole everything from us.

7
00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:57.311
And then my father died," he said.

8
00:00:57.312 --> 00:01:01.021
"Now we're poor."

9
00:01:01.022 --> 00:01:04.864
"My family is poor too," Eliza said.

10
00:01:04.865 --> 00:01:09.437
"My parents died several years ago.

11
00:01:09.438 --> 00:01:14.496
So I take care of my brothers and sisters."

12
00:01:14.497 --> 00:01:21.732
"Oh," Jack said. "That sounds hard."

13
00:01:21.733 --> 00:01:28.957
Eliza nodded. "You don't have any money.

14
00:01:28.958 --> 00:01:32.123
But you still have your mother.

15
00:01:32.124 --> 00:01:39.064
And that's a treasure."

16
00:01:39.065 --> 00:01:43.300
Jack nodded. "You're right.

17
00:01:43.301 --> 00:01:47.694
I'll try to remember that."

18
00:01:47.695 --> 00:01:58.658
Soon Jack started walking again.

19
00:01:58.659 --> 00:02:01.757
Mother ran outside as Jack got closer.

20
00:02:01.758 --> 00:02:06.493
"Did you find a job?" she called.

21
00:02:06.494 --> 00:02:09.092
Jack shook his head.

22
00:02:09.093 --> 00:02:12.624
"Nobody in town needs help," he said.

23
00:02:12.625 --> 00:02:20.749
Mother frowned. "We must sell Milky White."

24
00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:24.562
Jack gasped. "Oh no, Mother!

25
00:02:24.563 --> 00:02:26.838
We can't sell Milky White!

26
00:02:26.839 --> 00:02:29.528
We need her milk."

27
00:02:29.529 --> 00:02:34.343
"Milky White is not giving milk," Mother said firmly.

28
00:02:34.344 --> 00:02:39.796
"So we must sell her."

29
00:02:39.797 --> 00:02:42.863
Jack started to speak again.

30
00:02:42.864 --> 00:02:45.791
But Mother folded her arms.

31
00:02:45.792 --> 00:02:52.568
"You must sell Milky White tomorrow," she said.

32
00:02:52.569 --> 00:02:55.434
"We need the money for food."

33
00:02:55.435 --> 00:02:57.387
Jack hung his head.

34
00:02:57.388 --> 00:03:13.638
Mother was right.

